config-automod-remove_roles_on_mute = Which roles a role timeout takes off the member: false, true for every role that can be taken off, or a list of role ids.
config-automod-restore_roles_on_mute = Which of the roles taken off come back when the timeout ends: the same forms as remove_roles_on_mute. true by default.
